      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is actually not a VRChat bug. I've spent some time investigating this and it is actually caused by GetMaximumProcessorGroupCount not being implemented by Valve Proton 5.0, which is required by this version of OVRLipSync.dll. I'll see if I can fix this on the Proton side.",
