  "details": "Hi,\nthe 2020.04.02 update broke visemes and the following error messages can be found in the logs:\n2020.11.30 00:16:00 Warning    -  OvrLipSync Awake: Queried SampleRate: 48000 BufferSize: 1024\n2020.11.30 00:16:00 Warning    -  Plugins: Failed to load 'Z:/home/gameuser/.local/share/Steam/steamapps/common/VRChat/VRChat_Data/Plugins/OVRLipSync.dll' with error 'Message 0x%1 not found in file %2.\n'.\n2020.11.30 00:16:00 Exception  -  DllNotFoundException: Unable to load DLL 'OVRLipSync': The specified module could not be found.\nOVRLipSync.ǅǄǅǅǄǅǄǄǄǅǄǄǄǄǄǄǅǅǄǄǅǅǄǅǄǅǅǄǄǄǅǄǄǅǅǄǅǅǄǄǅǄǄǄǅǅǄ (System.Int32 ǄǄǄǅǅǄǅǄǄǅǄǄǄǄǄǅǄǅǄǄǅǄǅǄǄǄǅǅǄǅǄǅǅǄǄǄǅǅǅǅǅǄǄǅǄǅǄ, System.Int32 ǄǅǄǅǅǅǄǅǅǄǄǄǄǅǄǄǄǅǅǄǅǅǅǄǄǄǅǅǅǄǄǄǄǅǄǅǅǄǅǄǅǄǄǅǄǄǅ) (at <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0)\nOVRLipSync.ǅǅǄǄǄǄǄǄǅǄǄǄǄǅǄǄǄǅǄǅǅǄǅǅǅǅǄǄǄǅǅǅǅǅǄǅǅǄǄǄǅǅǄǅǄǄǅ () (at <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0)\nSome reports[1][2] indicate that replacing OVRLipSync.dll with a 3rd party version fixes the issue.\n\n\n[1] https://www.reddit.com/r/linux_gaming/comments/jvyx2n/vrchat_visemes_not_working_after_1117_update/\n[2] https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/1199#issuecomment-730962199",
